We had a good (but short) audio BOF at ELC-E last October and out of
that it was decided that it would should try and hold two audio BOFs per
year (co-hosted with ELC/Linux Foundation/Plumbers etc). One BOF would
be in Europe and the other in the US, thus giving most folks a chance to
attend and also easier to get approval due to the co-hosting with the
other interesting events. 

